<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Zakaryaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zakaryaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zaka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zakaryaasa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zakaryaasa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Zakaryaasa maxaafa koyro xiqisey, nabey Zakaryaasi, Baraka na7a, Ado na7a na7a gididaysa odees. Zakaryaasi Leewe koche; Isra7eele asay di7ope simmin, kahinenne nabe gididi Yerusalaamen Xoossas haggazida ase.</para>
  <para style="ip">Zakaryaasi maxaafa xaafana mela gaaso gidida nam7u qofati de7oosona. Koyro qofay, di7ope simmidi Yihudan de7iya asay xoossa keethi keexo doomana melanne wursethi gakanaw minnidi eqana mela minthethanaasa. Nam7antho qofay, Kiristoosi simmidi yaanaw gam7in ufaysi qanxida asay, I yaa wode waanidi qoncanaw de7iyako enta akeekisanaasa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Zakaryaasa maxaafay nam7u gita kifiletan shaaketees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">1. Shempo 1—8 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, K.Y.S. xeetanne laatamu laythafe bidi ichashu xeetanne tammanne ichashu laythi gakanaw de7iya laythata giddon, dumma dumma wodetan nabey Zakaryaasi odida tinbite qaala oykis. Ha nabey odida qaalati qoncetha maaran shiiqidosona. Hessika, Yerusalaamey ooraxanaba, xoossa keethi simmidi keexetanaba, Xoossa asay geeyanabanne yaana Kiristoosa laythaba odees.</para>
  <para style="ipi">2. Shempo 9—14 gakanaw de7iya kifiley ba huuphen nam7an shaaketees. Ha kifileti “Kiita woyko qaala” giya odan qoncidosona (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 9:1">9:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:1">12:1</ref></char>). Koyro qaalay, yaana geetetida Kiristoosa baggara Isra7eeles atotetha ufaysi de7eysa odees. Ha nabey odida qaalati sinthafe yaana Kiristoosa wursetha pirdaba odees (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 9:1-11:17">9:1—11:17</ref></char>). Nam7antho qaalay, Isra7eele Godaako zaaridi simonne ooratha dere gigidi Godaa sinthan duussaba odees (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 12:1-14:21">12:1—14:21</ref></char>). He wode, Dawita soo asaas, “Nagarapenne tunatethafe geeshshiya pultoy dhuuqana” (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 13:1">13:1</ref></char>). Isra7eeley, “Xoossay, nu Godaa” yaagana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 13:9">13:9</ref></char>). Kiristoosi kawo gididi Yerusalaame haarana (shem 14).</para>
  <para style="ip">Wursethan, Haggey, di7ope simmida asay xoossa keethi keexana mela denthethiya wode, Zakaryaasi Xoossafe ekida qoncethaninne qaalan Yerusalaameynne xoossa keethay zaaridi ooraxanaysa odees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Qoncethatanne qaalata <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEC 1:1-8:23">1:1—8:23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Taako simmite ta hinteko simmana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEC 1:1-6">1:1-6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Hospun qamma qoncethatanne mallata <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEC 1:7-6:15">1:7—6:15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Xooma, kiitetethinne anjetethi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEC 7:1-8:23">7:1—8:23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kawoy simmana <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEC 9:1-14:21">9:1—14:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Koyro qaala: ayseysatanne enti aysiya asaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEC 9:1-11:17">9:1—11:17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Nam7antho: asaanne enta ayseysata <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ZEC 12:1-14:21">12:1—14:21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Goday Ba Asaa Xeegees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1"/>Daariyosi kawotida nam7antho laythan, hospuntho ageenan, Godaa qaalay Ido na7aa, Baraka na7aa, nabiya Zakariyasako yis.<verse eid="ZEC 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2"/>“Goday hinte mayzata bolla daro hanqetis. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3"/>Shin ha77i asaas haysada yaagada oda: ‘Taako simmite; taani hinteko simmana’ yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4"/>Kase nabeti, hinte aawatako, ‘Hinte iita ogiyapenne iita oosuwape simmite’ yaagidi odin, si7onna ixidi, banta iita ogiyapenne oosuwape simmonna ixida, hinte mayzatada hanopite” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5"/>Hinte mayzati ha77i awun de7oona? He nabeti merinaw paxa de7oona? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6"/>Gidoshin, nabeta, ta aylleta baggara taani odida kiitatinne higgeti ubbay hinte mayzata bolla gakibeennee? Yaatin, enti banta nagara paaxidi, “Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday nu ogiyadanne nu oosuwada nuus immana gidaysada ba oosuwa oothis” yaagidosona.<verse eid="ZEC 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Parata Qoncethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7"/>Daariyosi kawotida nam7antho laythan, Shabaaxa geetetiya tammanne issintho ageenan, laatamanne oyddantho gallasan, Godaa qaalay Ido na7aa, Baraka na7aa, nabiya Zakariyasako yis. <verse eid="ZEC 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8"/>Taani qamma qoncethan, zo7o para toggida issi asi be7as. I zangaaran de7iya barseneete geetetiya mithata garsan eqis; iyape guye baggara zo7o, daamanne bootha parati de7oosona. <verse eid="ZEC 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9"/>Yaatin taani, “Ta godaw, haysati aybee?” yaagada oychas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:9">Taara haasaya kiitanchoy, “Haysati aybeko taani nena bessaana” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10"/>Barseneete mitha garsan eqida uray, “Haysati sa7aa ubbaa yuuyidi wochana mela Goday kiittidaysata” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11"/>Enti barseneete mithaa garsan eqida Godaa kiitanchuwako, “Nuuni sa7a ubbaa yuuyidi wochida; sa7i wopu gidi saro de7ees” yaagidosona.<verse eid="ZEC 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12"/>Hessafe guye, Godaa kiitanchoy, “Abeeti Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaw, neeni hanqetin ha77i laapun tammu laythi kumis; yaatin, neeni Yerusalaamenne Yihuda katamata maaronna awude gakanaw gam7anee?” yaagis. <verse eid="ZEC 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13"/>Goday taara haasaya kiitanchawas lo77onne minthethiya qaalan zaaro immis.<verse eid="ZEC 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14"/>Taara haasaya kiitanchoy taako, “Ha qaala awaaja! Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, ‘Taani Yerusalaamesinne Xiyoones daro mishetayis. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15"/>Nuuni saro de7oos gidi qopiya hara kawotethata bolla taani daro hanqetas. Taani ta asaa bolla guuthara hanqetas, shin enti aathidi ta deriya qohidosona.’ <verse eid="ZEC 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16"/>Hessa gisho, taani Yerusalaameko maarotan simmana; ta keethay zaaridi yan keexetana; Yerusalaame katama bolla wadha wodoro yeggana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17"/>Gujada haysada yaagada awaaja: “Ta katamata duretethay kumidi palahana; taani Goday Xiyoone zaara minthethana; Yerusalaame zaara doorana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyddu Kaceta Qoncethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18"/>Taani qoncethan oyddu kaceta be7as. <verse eid="ZEC 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19"/>Taara haasaya kiitanchuwa, “Haysati aybee?” yaagada oychas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19">I zaaridi, “Ha kaceti Yihuda, Isra7eelenne Yerusalaame laallida kawotethata” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20"/>Hessafe guye, Goday tana birata qoxiya oyddu hiillanchota bessis. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21"/>Taani, “Haysati ay oothanaw yidona?” yaagada oychas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:21">I zaaridi, “Haysati oonika zaari denthona mela Yihuda biitta laallida kaceta kawushanawunne dhaysanaw yidosona. Enti Yihuda biitta laallanaw banta kaciya denthida hara kawotethata kaciya shocidi sa7an yegganaw yidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yegetha Wodoro Oykida Ura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1"/>Hara qoncethan ba kushen wadha wodoro oykida issi asi be7as. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2"/>Taani, “Neeni aw bay?” yaagada oychas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 2:2">I zaaridi, “Taani Yerusalaame dalgatethaynne adussatethay ay meleko wadhanaw bayis” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3"/>Hessafe guye, taara haasaya kiitanchoy keyidi bis; iyara gahetanaw hara kiitanchoy yis. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4"/>Yida kiitanchoy, “Woxa bada, na7atetha addiyako, ‘Yerusalaamen daro asinne daro mehey daana gisho, katamaa yuushon gimbe dirsi koshshenna. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5"/>Taani iya yuushuwan tama dirsi gidana; taani iyaw boncho gidana’ yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6"/>“Taani hintena biitta oyddu baggaa laallida gisho, yaape keyite; elle keyite; pudeha bagga biittafe baqatite” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7"/>“Neno, Xiyoone keya; Babiloone macca nayta giddon de7iyare, enta giddofe baqata” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday iya bonchuwa qoncisana mela, ba asaa bonqida kawotethatako tana kiittidi, “Hintena bochiya uray iya ayfiya buluwa bochees. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9"/>Taani ta kushiya enta bolla denthana; enta aylleti enta zaaridi bonqana. He wode hinte Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday tana kiittidaysa erana.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10"/>“Taani yada hinte giddon daana gisho, Xiyoone asaw, zamarite; ufaytite!” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11"/>He wode daro kawotethati Godaara gahetidi iya ase gidana. I hinte giddon daana; Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday tana hinteko kiittidaysa he wode hinte erana. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12"/>Geeshsha biittan Yihuda, bana gakida gisho oothidi laattana; Yerusalaame zaaridi doorana. <verse eid="ZEC 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13"/>Goday ba de7iya geeshsha bessan dendida gisho, asho ma77ida ubbay iya sinthan si77i go!<verse eid="ZEC 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Kahine Halaqa Ma7uwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1"/>Hessafe guye, kahine halaqay Iyyasuy Godaa kiitanchuwa sinthan eqidaysanne xalahey Iyyasu mootanaw iyape ushacha baggara eqidaysa tana qoncethan bessis. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2"/>Goday, “Xalahiyaw, Goday nena seero; Yerusalaame doorida Goday nena seero! Ha addey tamape attida duncha mela gidennee?” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3"/>Iyyasuy qitatida ma7o ma77idi kiitanchuwa sinthan eqis. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4"/>Kiitanchoy ba sinthan eqidaysata, “Iya bollafe ha qita ma7uwa qaarite” yaagis. Qassi Iyyasuko, “Heko, taani ne nagara neepe diggas; boncho ma7uwa nena mayzana.” <verse eid="ZEC 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5"/>Taani, “Geeshsha xaatha qaciya iya huuphen xaaxite” yaagis. Enti kiittidaysada oothidosona; ma7o mayzidosona. Godaa kiitanchoy he wode iya miyen eqis.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6"/>Hessafe guye, Godaa kiitanchoy Iyyasuko, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees; “Neeni ta ogiyan hemetikonne ta kiita naagiko, neeni ta keethaa aysana; ta dabaaban aawatana. Qassi haysan eqidaysatara issife geliyanne keyiya maata new immana. <verse eid="ZEC 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8"/>Kahine halaqa Iyyasu, haysa si7a! Sinthara yaana lo77obaas malaata gididaysatinne neera ootheysati haysa si7o! Taani, ‘Tashe’ geetetiya ta aylliya ehana. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9"/>Heko, taani Iyyasu sinthan shuchu wothana; he shucha bolla laapun ayfeti de7oosona. Taani he shuchaa woocada iya bolla xuufe xaafana; ha biitta nagara issi gallas diggana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10"/>“He gallas hinte ubbay hinte woynenne hinte balase garsan uttidi hinte shooruwa xeegana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 3:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Xompe Wothiya Kocaa Qoncethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1"/>Hessafe guye, taara haasaya kiitanchoy simmidi yidi, dhiskida asi barkiya mela tana barkisis. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2"/>I taako, “Neeni ay be7ay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:2">Taani zaarada, “Taani worqa xalaalape oosetida xompe wothiya kocaa be7ayis; iya xeeran zayte xaaroy de7ees. Qassi iya bolla laapun xompeti de7oosona; he laapun xompetas laapun laapun piiqeti de7oosona. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3"/>He xompiya wothiya kocaa matan nam7u shamaho mithati de7oosona. Enti zayte xaaruwape ushacha baggaranne haddirsa baggara de7oosona” yaagas.<verse eid="ZEC 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4"/>Taara haasaya kiitanchuwa, “Ta godaw, haysi aybee?” yaagada oychas.<verse eid="ZEC 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5"/>Kiitanchoy zaaridi, “Haysati aybeko erikii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:5">Taani zaarada, “Ta godaw, taani erike” yaagas.<verse eid="ZEC 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6"/>I taako, “Zarubaabelas Goday odida qaalay haysa; ‘Ta Ayyaananape attishin, wolqan woyko minotethan gidenna’ yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday. <verse eid="ZEC 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7"/>Gita zumaw, neeni aybee? Neeni Zarubaabela sinthan lichi gida demba gidana. Zarubaabeli xoossa keethaa keexi polidi, wursetha shuchaa kessiya wode asay, ‘Hashshu! Hashshu poletis’ ” yaagana.<verse eid="ZEC 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8"/>Qassika Godaa qaalay taako haysada yaagidi yis. <verse eid="ZEC 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9"/>“Xoossaa keetha baasuwa Zarubaabela kusheti baasidosona; iya kusheti keexidi polana. Hessafe guye, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday tana hinteko kiittidaysa hinte erana. <verse eid="ZEC 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10"/>Ha guutha doomethaa kadhiya oonika guyepe ufaytana; enti Zarubaabela kushen tumbiya be7ana. Haysati laapun xompeti biitta ubbaa yuuyidi xeelliya Godaa ayfeta” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11"/>Taani kiitanchuwa zaarada, “Ha xompe wothiya kocaape ushacha baggaranne haddirsa baggara de7iya ha nam7u shamahoti aybee?” yaagada oychas. <verse eid="ZEC 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12"/>Gujadaka, “Zaytey entafe goggiya nam7u worqa piiqeta matan de7iya nam7u shamaho mitha tasheti aybee?” yaagada oychas.<verse eid="ZEC 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13"/>I zaaridi, “Haysati aybeko neeni erikii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:13">Taani zaarada, “Ta godaw, taani erike” yaagas.<verse eid="ZEC 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14"/>I zaaridi, “Haysati sa7a ubbaa Godaas oothiya nam7u tiyetida asata” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 4:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Xaatha Maxaafa Qoncethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1"/>Qassi taani dhoqu gada xeelliya wode bollara piradhiya issi xaatha maxaafa be7as.<verse eid="ZEC 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2"/>Kiitanchoy tana, “Neeni ay be7ay?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:2">Taani zaarada, “Taani bollara piradhiya issi xaatha maxaafa be7ayis; he maxaafa adussatethay laatamu wadha qassi gompay tammu wadha” yaagas.<verse eid="ZEC 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3"/>I taako, “Ha xaatha maxaafaa giddon biitta ubbaa bolla yaana baadethay xaafetis. He maxaafan issi baggara, ‘Kayso ubbay biittafe dhayana’; qassi hanko baggara, ‘Wordon caaqiya ubbay dhayana’ giya xuufey xaafetis. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4"/>‘Taani ha baadetha kiittana; he baadethay bidi, kaysuwa soonne ta sunthan wordo caaqeysa soo gelana. He keetha gelidi mithaanne shuchaa dhaysana’ ” yaages Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daachon Utida Maccase Qoncethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5"/>Hessafe guye, taara haasaya kiitanchoy taako yidi, “Ane dhoqu gada, yaabay aybeko be7a” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6"/>Taani, “I aybee?” yaagada oychas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:6">I zaaridi, “Haysi makiya daacho” yaagis. Qassi gujidi, “Haysi asay ha biitta ubban oothida naaquwa malaata” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7"/>Irsaase geetetiya biratape oosetida daachuwa kamaa denthiya wode issi maccasi daachuwan uttasu. <verse eid="ZEC 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8"/>Kiitanchoy, “Hanna iitatetha leemiso” yaagis. Iyo guye daachuwan yeggidi irsaase kamaa zaaridi kammis.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9"/>Hessafe guye taani dhoqu gada xeelliya wode enta qefiyan carkoy de7iya, piradhiya nam7u maccasata be7as. Enta qefey gollo qefe mela mino; enti daachuwa sa7ape dinthidi ekidi piradhidosona.<verse eid="ZEC 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10"/>Taani kiitanchuwako, “Haysati daachuwa awu efoona?” yaagada oychas.<verse eid="ZEC 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11"/>I zaaridi, “Enti iyaw keethe keexanaw Sana7oora biitta efoosona. Keethay keexeti simmiko enti he daachuwa iyaw giigida bessan wothana” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 5:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Oyddu Para Gaareta Qoncethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1"/>Qassi taani dhoqu gada xeelliya wode oyddu para gaareti nam7u naase birata deretape giddora yeyisata be7as. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2"/>Koyro gaariya zo7o parati goochosona; nam7antho gaariya kareetha parati goochosona. <verse eid="ZEC 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3"/>Heedzantho gaariya bootha parati goochosona; oyddantho gaariya wanco parati goochosona. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4"/>Taani kiitanchuwako, “Ta godaw, haysati aybee?” yaagada oychas.<verse eid="ZEC 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5"/>Kiitanchoy zaaridi, “Haysati biitta ubbaa Godaa sinthan eqidi oothiya oyddu salo carkota. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6"/>Kareetha parati goochiya gaarey pudeha bagga biitta bees; bootha parati goochiya gaarey wuloha bagga bees; wanco parati goochiya gaarey dugeha bagga bees” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7"/>He parati biitta wochanaw keyida wode gede haa pachiparoosona. Kiitanchoy entako, “Bidi biitta ubbaa yuuyidi wochite” yaagis. Enti bidi biitta ubbaa yuuyidi wochidosona. <verse eid="ZEC 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8"/>Hessafe guye, kiitanchoy ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Heko, pudeha bagga biitta bida parati ta Ayyaana he biittan shempisidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyasus Giigida Kallacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9"/>Godaa qaalay taako haysada yaagishe yis: <verse eid="ZEC 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10"/>“Babiloone di7etethaafe simmida Heldayi, Xoobeynne Yadayi immiya biranne worqa imota ekada he gallas Sofoniyaasa na7aa Iyosyaasa soo ba. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11"/>Entafe ekida birapenne worqafe kallacha medhada Iyosadeqa na7aa, kahine halaqaa Iyyasu huuphen wotha. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees gada iyaw oda: heko, tashey ba bessan daaya gishonne I xoossa keetha keexiya gisho, iya sunthay ‘Tashe geetetida addey haysa. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13"/>Godaa keetha keexanay iya; I kawotetha ma7uwa ma77idi, araatan uttidi haarana. Qassi iya araata matan issi kahiney eqana; enta nam7aa giddon issifetethi daana.’ <verse eid="ZEC 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14"/>He kallachay Heldaya, Xoobbiya, Yadayanne Sofoniyaasa na7aa Iyosyaasa qofiso gididi, Godaa xoossa keethan daana” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15"/>He wode haaho bessan de7iya asati Godaa keetha keexidi maaddanaw yaana. Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday tana hinteko kiittidaysa hinte hessan erana. Godaas, hinte Xoossaas hinte polo kiitetiko hessi hanana.<verse eid="ZEC 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Suure Pirdanne Maarotethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1"/>Daariyosi kawotida oyddantho laythan, Kisiila geetetiya uddufuntho ageenan, oyddantho gallasan, Zakariyasako yida Godaa qaalay haysa. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2"/>Beetele katamaa asay Sarezeera, Regem-Melekanne entara issife de7iya asata Godaa anjoy yaana mela woossanaw kiittidosona. <verse eid="ZEC 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3"/>Qassi Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa keethan oothiya kahinetanne nabeta, “Daro laythi oothishe gam7idaysada nuuni ha77ika ichashantho ageenan yeekanawunne xoomanaw bessii?” yaagidi oychana mela kiittidosona.<verse eid="ZEC 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4"/>Hessafe guye, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa qaalay haysada yaagidi taako yis: <verse eid="ZEC 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5"/>“Biittan de7iya asa ubbaasinne kahinetas haysada yaagada oda: ‘Hinte ha aadhida laapun tammu laythan ichashantho ageenaninne laapuntha ageenan xoomidaynne yeekiday tana bonchanaasee? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6"/>Hinte miya wodenne uyaa wode hintew meetanne uyeeta. <verse eid="ZEC 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7"/>Yerusalaame katamaynne iya yuushuwan de7iya katamatan de7iya asay shemponinne injen de7ida wodenne Negebaninne gadhan asay wopu gidi de7ida wode Goday ba nabeta baggara odida qaalay haysa gidennee?’ yaaga” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8"/>Godaa qaalay Zakariyasako haysada yaagidi yis: <verse eid="ZEC 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9"/>“Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday kase immida kiitay, ‘Suure pirdaa pirdite; hinte issoy issuwas keehatethinne maarotethi oothite. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10"/>Am7eta, yi7ota, bete asaanne manqota naaqofite. Qassi hintefe oonika ba ishaa bolla iitabaa oothanaw ba wozanan qopofo.’<verse eid="ZEC 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11"/>“Shin enti si7onna ixidosona; zoko zaaridi banta haythaa tuccidosona. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday ba Ayyaanan kase ba nabeta baggara kiitida higgiyanne qaala si7onna ixidi banta wozanaa zaallada minthidosona. Hessa gisho, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa matape gita hanqoy enta bolla yis. <verse eid="ZEC 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13"/>Taani xeegiya wode enti si7onna ixidaysada enti xeegiya wode taani si7ike” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14"/>“Taani gote ehada enti eronna kawotethata giddon laallas. Biittay asi yaanne haanne simeretonna kaysa biitta gidis; ha lo77o biittay baysa gidis” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 7:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaamey Ooraxana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa qaalay qassika taako haysada yaagidi yis: <verse eid="ZEC 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, “Taani Xiyoones daro qadhetayis; I mishay tana xuuggees. <verse eid="ZEC 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3"/>Taani Xiyoone simmada Yerusalaamen daana. Qassi Yerusalaamey ammanthiya katama geetetada eretana. Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa zumay Geeshsha Zuma geetetidi xeegetana” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEC 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday, “Cimidi guufera biya addeynne maccasay kaseysada Yerusalaame dabaaban uttana. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5"/>Yerusalaame katamaa ogeti kaa7iya addenne macca naytan kumana” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEC 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6"/>“Attida asaas hessi malaalsiyaba gidikoka, tana hessi malaalsiyabayee? yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday. <verse eid="ZEC 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7"/>Heko taani ta asaa dolohapenne wulohape shiishana. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8"/>Enti Yerusalaamen daana mela oothana. Enti ta ase gidana; taani xillonne ammanthiya enta Xoossaa gidana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees: “Hinteno, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa keethaa baasoy yegetida gallasaape doomidi nabeti odida qaala si7idaysato, hinte kushiya minthite; oosuwa minnidi polite. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10"/>He wodiyape kase asaas damoozey, mehiyas qanxetiya keri baawa. Taani asa ubbaa issuwa issuwa bolla morketethan denthida gisho, geleysasinne keyeysas saroy baawa. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11"/>Shin ha77i taani ha attida asaa bolla kase oothidaysada oothike” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12"/>“Entii zerida ubbay dolana; woyney ba ayfiya immana; goshshay kathan kumana; saloti banta ira immana. Haysa ubba attida asaas laata oothada immana. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13"/>Hinteno, Yihuda asaw, Isra7eele asaw, kawotethata giddon hinte baadetidaysata gidideta, shin ha77i taani hintena ashshana; hinte anjetidaysata gidana. Yayyofite! hinte kushiya minthite!” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEC 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14"/>“Hinte mayzati tana yiloyida wode enta qadhey bayna seeranaw qofa qachas. <verse eid="ZEC 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15"/>Ha77i taani Yerusalaamesinne Yihudas lo77oba oothanaw qofa qachas. Hiza yayyofite! <verse eid="ZEC 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16"/>Hinte oothanaw koshshiyabay haysa: issoy issuwara tumaa odetite; pirda dabaaban tumaanne saruwa ehiya pirda pirdite. <verse eid="ZEC 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17"/>Issoy issuwa qohanaw iitabaa hinte wozanan maqetofite; wordon caaqofite. Hayisata ubbaa taani ixayis” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa qaalay qassika taako haysada yaagidi yis: <verse eid="ZEC 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19"/>“Oyddantho, ichashantho, laapunthonne tammantho ageenan hinte xoomida xoomay Yihuda asaas ufaysinne inje wode gidana. Hessa gisho, hinte tumatethinne sarotethi dosite” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEC 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20"/>“Daro asaynne daro katamatan de7iya asay Yerusalaame yaana. <verse eid="ZEC 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21"/>Issi kataman de7iya asay hara kataman de7iya asaako bidi, ‘Godaa anjoy yaana mela woossanawunne Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa koyanaw ane boos; taanika bayis’ yaagana. <verse eid="ZEC 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22"/>Qassi daro asaynne wolqaama kawotethati Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa koyanawunne woossanaw Yerusalaame yaana. <verse eid="ZEC 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23"/>He gallasatan dumma dumma qaalan haasaya kawotethata ubbaafe tammu asati yidi, issi Ayhude addiya ma7uwa macaraa oykidi, ‘Xoossay hintera de7eysa nuuni si7ida gisho, nuuni hintera baana’ yaagana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 8:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Morketi Pirdetana Pirda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1"/>Asaa ayfeynne Isra7eele asa ubbaa ayfey Godaa xeelliya gisho, Sadraaka biittaynne Damasqo katamay dhayanaysa, Goday odida pirda qaalay haysa. <verse eid="ZEC 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2"/>Qassi ha pirday Hadraaka zawa gidida Hamaata katamaanne qara gidida Xiroosanne Sidoona katamata bolla ha pirday gakana. <verse eid="ZEC 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3"/>Xiroosa katamay baw mino miixa gimbis. Qassi biraanne worqaa biittada dooris. <verse eid="ZEC 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4"/>Shin I shiishidaba ubbaa Goday ekana; iya shaluwa abban holana; katamay taman meetetana.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5"/>Asqaloona katamay hessa be7idi yayyana; Gaaza katamay un7etana; Eqroona katamay ufaysi dhayana. Gaaza kawoy dhayana; Asqaloona katamay kaysa gidana. <verse eid="ZEC 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6"/>Ashdooda kataman walaha asay daana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 9:6">Goday haysada yaagees: “Filisxeemeta otoruwa taani wursana. <verse eid="ZEC 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7"/>Taani enta doonape suuthi, enta achaafe tunaba diggana. Entafe attidaysati nu Xoossaa asi gidana; qassi Yihuda yaraape issuwa gidana. Eqroona asay Yaabuse asaada ta ase gidana. <verse eid="ZEC 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8"/>Hessafe guye, olanchoti oykonnaada, taani ta keethaa naagana. Taani ta huuphen naagiya gisho, zaaridi oonika ta asaa un7ethenna” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xiyoone Kawa Yuussaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9"/>Neno, Xiyoone katame, ufayta! Neno, Yerusalaame katame, ilila! Heko, xoonida ne xillo kawoy neeko yees. Ne kawoy ashke gididi, hare bolla, aadhidi hare mara bolla uttidi neeko yees.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10"/>Taani para gaareta Isra7eelepe, ola parata Yerusalaamepe dhaysana; ola dongiya mentherethana. Ne kawoy kawotethatas saro awaajana; I abbas gaxape hini gaxa gakanaw Efraxiisa shaafape doomidi sa7aa gaxaa gakanaw haarana.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11"/>Taani neera suutha caaquwa gisho, qashetida ne asata haathi bayna ollaafe kessana. <verse eid="ZEC 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12"/>Hinteno, sinthan ufaysi de7iya qasho asato, hinte miixaa simmite. Kaseysa gisho dako shalo hintew immanaysa hachi taani hintew awaajayis. <verse eid="ZEC 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13"/>Taani Yihuda dongeda, Isra7eele donge toorada go7etana. Xiyoone, taani ne nayta Girike nayta bolla denthana; nena wolqaama olanchuwa mashshaa mela oothana.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14"/>He wode Goday enta bolla qoncana; iya donge tooray wol7antha wol7amana. Ubbaa Haariya Goday moyze punnana; dugeha bagga goteda dendana. <verse eid="ZEC 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday enta gisho oletana. Enti banta morketa wursana; yambarshan oleyisata yedhana. Enti banta morketa suuthaa woyne ushsha uyana; suuthi keren kumiyada kumana; enti yarsho bessan gukiya suuthada gukana.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16"/>He gallas henthanchoy ba dorsata ashsheysada Goday enta Xoossay enta ashshana. Kallacha bolla de7iya alleeqoda enti Godaa biittan phoolana. <verse eid="ZEC 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17"/>Enti waanidi lo77onne puulancho gidandesha! Na7atetha nayta kathay, geela7o nayta woyne ushshay aacisana.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Yihuda Anjana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1"/>Balgoy gakiya wode Goday ira immana mela woossite. Goday ira tookida shaara kiittees; asaas ira immees; goshshan atakilte dolisis. <verse eid="ZEC 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2"/>Eeqati hadaba odoosona; maroti wordo qoncethi be7oosona; amuheysati wordo amuho odoosona; hada minthetho minthethoosona. Hessa gisho, asay dhayida dorsada toylatoosona; enta heemmiya asi bayna gisho, enti qohetidosona.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3"/>Goday haysada yaagees: “Ta hanqoy henthanchota bolla eexi keyis; he kaaletheyisata taani seerana. Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday ba wudiya Yihuda heemmees. I enta olas giigida wolqaama para mela oothana. <verse eid="ZEC 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4"/>Yihuda asaa giddofe quste shuchaa mela, dunkaane dhishe melanne ola toora mela hanida kaaletheysati keyana. <verse eid="ZEC 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5"/>Banta morketa ogiya urqada yedhiya mino olanchota mela gidana. Goday entara de7iya gisho, enti oletidi xoonana.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6"/>“Taani Yihuda asaa minthethana; Yoosefa asaa ashshana. Taani entaw qadhetiya gisho, enta zaarada ehana. Enti taani kaseka enta yeggaboonna asa mela gidana. Taani Godaa enta Xoossaa gidiya gisho, enta woosa si7ana. <verse eid="ZEC 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7"/>Isra7eele asay mino olancho mela gidana; woyne uyida asada enta wozanay ufaytana. Enta nayti hessa be7idi, hashshu gaana; enta wozanay Godan ufaytana.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8"/>“Taani ta asaa suyqada xeegana; enta issife shiishana. Taani enta wozana; enti kaseysada darana. <verse eid="ZEC 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9"/>Taani enta kawotethata giddon laallikoka enti banta de7iya haaho biittan gididi tana hassayana. Qassi entinne enta nayti de7on daananne banta biitta simmana.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10"/>“Taani enta Gibxe biittafe zaarana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">Asoore biittafe enta shiishana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Entaw uttiya bessi dhayana gakanaw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">taani enta Galada biittaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">Libaanose biittan kunthana.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11"/>Enti meto abba giddora aadhiya wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">taani Goday abba seerana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Ciimmo gidida Nayle shaafay melana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">Asoore biitta otoroy kawuyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">Gibxe kawotetha xam7ay meqana.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12"/>Taani, enta Goday enta minthana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">enti iya sunthan hemetana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">taani Goday haysa odayis” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1"/>Neno, Libaanose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:1">tami ne zigata maana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:1">ne pengeta dooya!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2"/>Neno xiiddaw, zigay kundida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">boncho mithati dhayida gisho, yii gada yeeka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Hinteno Baasane wolato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">he siketida woray man7etida gisho, yii gidi yeekite.<verse eid="ZEC 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3"/>Enta lo77o hentha bessay dhayida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">Henthanchota zelelsa si7ite;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Yordaanose woray dhayida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">Gaammoti gudeysa si7ite.<verse eid="ZEC 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nam7u Henthanchota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4"/>Goday ta Xoossay taako haysada yaagis: “Shukettanaw de7iya dorsa wudiya heemma. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5"/>Enta shammeysati shukoosona; shin seerettokona. Bayzeysati, ‘Nuuni duretida; Goday galatetto’ yaagosona; hari attoshin, enta henthanchoti entaw qadhetokona” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6"/>Goday haysada yaagees: “Taani hizape guye ha biittan de7iya asaas qadhetike. Taani issi issi ase iya shooruwasinne iya kawas aathada immana. Enti biitta dhaysana; taani issi asika enta kushiyape ashshike” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEC 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7"/>Hessa gisho, taani shukettanaw de7iya dorsata, aathada qassi wudiya giddon un7etidaysata heemmeysa gidas. Yaatada dorsata heemmanaw nam7u xam7ata ekada, issuwa “Dosetidaysa” gada xeegas; nam7anthuwa “Issifetethi” gada xeegas. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8"/>Taani issi ageenan heedzu henthanchota dhaysas. Enta hanotethay taw danda7etenna; entika tana ixidosona. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9"/>Yaata simmada ta dorsatako, “Taani hintena nam7antho heemmike; hayqeysi hayqo; dhayeysi dhayo; attidaysati issoy issuwa mo” yaagas.<verse eid="ZEC 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10"/>Hessafe guye, taani “Dosetidaysa” geetetiya xam7a ekada menthas. Hessa ta oothiday kawotethatara gelida caaqoy duuxidaysa bessanaasa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11"/>He gallas caaqoy me77is; he wode dorse shammeysatinne bayzaysati tana be7idi, hessi Godaa qaala gideysa eridosona. <verse eid="ZEC 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12"/>Taani, “Hinte dosiko ta damooziya immite; ixas giiko aggaagite” yaagas. Yaatin enti taw hastamu bira santime immidosona.<verse eid="ZEC 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13"/>Goday taako, “Enti immida boncho miishiya efada xoossa keethan de7iya otuwan yegga” yaagis. Taani he miishiya efada xoossa keethan de7iya otuwan yeggas. <verse eid="ZEC 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14"/>Hessafe guye, taani Yihudasinne Isra7eeles giddon de7iya ishatethay dhayidaysa bessanaw “Issifetethi” geetetiya ta nam7antho xam7aa menthas.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15"/>Qassika Goday tana, “Nam7antho bada pathonna henthanchota miishiya eka. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16"/>Taani ha biittan issi henthancho denthana. I qohetida dorsata maaddenna; laaletida dorsata shiishenna; meqida dorsata koolenna; paxa de7eyisata heemmenna. Shin I hessa aggidi, modhota shukidi mees; enta koliziya dhoggees. <verse eid="ZEC 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17"/>Dorsa wudiya yeggi dhayida he pathonna henthanchota ayye! Iya qesiyanne iya ushacha ayfiya bolla mashshi wodho. Iya ushacha kushey silo; iya ushacha ayfey qooqo” yaagis.<verse eid="ZEC 11:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame Morketi Dhayana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1"/>Salota micciday, sa7aa medhiday, asas de7o ayyaana immida Goday Isra7eeleba odida Godaa qaalay haysa: <verse eid="ZEC 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2"/>“Heko, taani Yerusalaame katamaa, iya yuushuwan de7iya asa ubbay uyin gandigarsiya woyne ushshi tigiya wanca oothana. Yerusalaamey oyketiya wode Yihuda katamati oyketana. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3"/>He wode taani Yerusalaame katamaa asa ubbaas deexo shuchu oothana; iya denthiya ubbay baw deshetana. Sa7aa kawotethati ubbay iya olanaw issife shiiqana. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4"/>He wode taani para ubbaa daganthana; para asata gooshshana.” Taani Goday haysa odayis. Yihuda asaa taani ta keeha ayfen xeellana; shin morketa parata ubbaa qooqisana. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5"/>He wode Yihuda halaqati banta wozanan, “Yerusalaame asay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godan, banta Xoossan, minotethaa demmidosona” yaagana.<verse eid="ZEC 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6"/>“He wode taani Yihuda kochata mitha dooriya giddon de7iya xiifanne mirqeeta giddon laxiya xompe oothana. Enti banta ushachan, banta haddirsaninne banta yuushuwan de7iya asa ubbaa maana; shin Yerusalaame katamay, asay saro de7iya bessi gidana.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7"/>“Dawita kochata bonchoynne Yerusalaamen de7eyisata bonchoy Yihuda asaa bonchuwafe aadhona mela taani Goday kasetada Yihuda asaas xoono immana. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8"/>He wode enta giddon daro laafa geetetiya asi Dawita mela mino gidana. Taani Goday Yerusalaamen de7eysatas gondalle gidana. Dawita kochati Xoossa mela, Godaa kiitancho mela gididi enta kaalethana. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9"/>He wode taani Yerusalaame olanaw dendiya kawotethata ubbaa dhaysanaw dendana.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10"/>“He wode taani Dawita kochata bollanne Yerusalaamen de7iya asaa bolla qadhenne woosa ayyaana gussana. Hessa gisho, enti banta caddidaysa be7iya wode asi ba issi na7as yeekeysada yeekana. Qassi ba bayra na7as kayoteysada kayotana. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11"/>He wode Yerusalaamen yeeketiya yeehoy Magido denban Hadaad-Rimoonas yeeketida yeehuwa mela wolqaama gidana. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12"/>Biittan de7iya issi issi kochay baw baw yeekana; Dawita kochati banta machetara, Naatana kochati banta machetara bantaw, <verse eid="ZEC 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13"/>Leewe kochati banta machetara bantaw, Same7a kochati banta machetara bantaw, yeekana. <verse eid="ZEC 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14"/>Attida kocha ubbay baw baw yeekana; enta macheti bantaw bantaw yeekana” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEC 12:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Nagarape Geeyethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysada yaagees: “He wode Dawita kochatanne Yerusalaamen de7eyisata nagarapenne tunatethafe geeshshiya pultoy dhuuqana. <verse eid="ZEC 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2"/>He wode taani enti nam7antho qofetonna mela eeqata sunthaa biittafe dhaysana. Qassi nabetanne tuna ayyaanata biittafe dhaysana. Taani Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday haysa odayis. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3"/>Qassi oonika, taani nabe giiko, iya aawanne aayiya iya, ‘Neeni Godaa sunthan wordo odiya gisho, hayqanaw bessees’ yaagana. I tinbite odiya wode iya aawaynne aayiya iya caddidi wodhana. <verse eid="ZEC 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4"/>He wode taani nabe giya oonika ba be7ida qoncethan yeellatana. Qassi ase cimmanaw ikisey de7iya ma7o ma77enna. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5"/>Shin I, ‘Taani nabe gidike; na7atethafe doomada biitta oothiya asi’ yaagana. <verse eid="ZEC 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6"/>Issi asi, ‘Yaatin, ha ne bolla de7iya madunthay aybee?’ yaagidi oychiko, i, ‘Haysi taani ta laggeta son madunxidaysa’ yaagana” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEC 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Henthanchoy shocetin Dorsati laaletidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7"/>“Mashshaw denda, taw mata gidida ta dorsata henthanchuwa bolla barka! Dorsati laaletana mela henthanchuwa wodha. Taani guutha dorsata bolla ta kushiya denthana” yaagees Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8"/>“Biitta ubban de7iya heedzu kushe asaape nam7u kushey shocetidi hayqin, issi kushe xalaali attana. Taani Goday haysa odayis. <verse eid="ZEC 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9"/>Ha attida siko asaa taani taman yeggana; biri taman geeyada enta geeshshana; worqey paacetiyada paacana. Hessafe guye, enti ta sunthan woossana; taani enta si7ana. Taani enta, ‘Ta ase’ gaana; enti, Goday, ‘Nu Xoosse’ yaagana” yaagees.<verse eid="ZEC 13:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Yaana, Kawotana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1"/>Heko, Godaa pirda gallasay yees; he wode hinte xeellishin, hintefe bonqidaba hinte sinthan shaaketana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2"/>Kawotethata ubbaa Goday Yerusalaame bolla olas shiishana. Katamay oyketana; keethay bonqetana; macca asaa wolqan iissana. Katamaa asaape baggay di7etidi baana; shin attida asay katamaape keyenna. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3"/>Hessafe guye, Goday keyidi, kase ola gallas oleteysada kawotethata olana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4"/>He gallas iya tohoti Yerusalaamepe doloha baggara de7iya Shamaho zuma bolla eqana. Shamaho Derey dolohape wuloha gakanaw nam7u keyidi phalqetin, daro gita zangaaray medhetana. Zumaape baggay pudeha bagga, qassi baggay dugeha bagga sher7i gaana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5"/>He zangaaray bidi Axeela gakana; hinte he zangaarara baqati aadhidi attana. Beni Yihuda kawa Ooziyaane laythi biittay qaaxin, hinte mayzati baqatidi attidaysada hinte baqatana. Hessafe guye, Goday ta Xoossay ba geeshshata ubbaara issife yaana.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6"/>He wode meegoy, shachinne dhumi deenna. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7"/>He wode qamminne gallasi baawa, Goday xalaali eriya dumma gallas gidana; he gallas qammay poo7o gidana.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8"/>He wode de7o haathay Yerusalaamepe goggana; iyape baggay Maxine Abban gelana; qassi baggay Medetiraane Abban gelana. He haathay balgonne bone goggishe daana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9"/>Goday biitta ubbaa bolla kawotana; he wode issi Godaa xalaali daana; iya sunthaa xalaala xeegana.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10"/>Gib7ape doomidi Yerusalaame dugeha baggara aadhidi Irmoona katamaa gakanaw de7iya biitta ubbay dembatana. Shin Yerusalaamey Biniyaame Pengiyafe bidi, beni pengiya ginara Zooze Pengiya gakanaw, qassi Hanan7eela Adussa Gimbiyafe bidi, kawo woyne gum7iya bessaa gakanaw ba bessan dhoqu gidi daana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11"/>Yerusalaamey asi de7iya bessi gidana; hizape guye dhayenna; iyan de7iya asay hirgi bayna saro daana.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12"/>Goday Yerusalaame olanaw dendida asa ubbaa bolla gado ehana. Enti eqon de7ishin, enta ashoy wooqana; enta ayfey ba ollan, enta inxarsay ba kottonuwan wooqana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13"/>He wode Goday enta wolqaama dagama daganthana. Asa ubbay issoy issuwa kushiya oykidi oletana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14"/>Yihuda asay Yerusalaame bagga gididi oletana. Yuushuwan de7iya kawotethata, tayboy bayna shaluwa, worqaa, biraanne ma7uwa di77idi shiishana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15"/>Ha gaduwa daaniya gadoy parata bolla, baqulota bolla, gimaleta bolla, hareta bollanne morketi dunkaanida bessan de7iya mehe ubbaa bolla yaana.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16"/>Hessafe guye, Yerusalaame olida kawotethatape attida ubbay Kawa, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa goyinnanawunne Shaqara Ba7aale bonchanaw laythan laythan Yerusalaame baana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17"/>Sa7an de7iya asaape oonika Kawa, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa goyinnanaw Yerusalaame boonna ixiko, entaw iri bukenna. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18"/>Gibxe asay bidi goyinnona ixiko, Shaqara Ba7aale bonchanaw boonna ixida asaa bolla gakida gadoy enta bolla yaana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19"/>Shaqara Ba7aale bonchanaw boonna ixida Gibxeynne hara kawotethati ubbay seeretana seeray haysa.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20"/>He wode parata qoodhen de7iya shaashshotiya bolla, “Godaas Geeyidaysa” geetetiya malla xuufey xaafetana. Xoossa keethan de7iya kathiya otoy yarsho bessa matan de7iya saaniya mela geeshshi gidana. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21"/>Yerusalaameninne Yihudan de7iya oto ubbay Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaas geeshshi gidana. Yarsho yarshiya asa ubbay he otota ekidi, yarsho ashuwa entan kathana. He wode Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa keethan ay zal7anchoy deenna.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14"/>
</usx>
